{{also|Schreiben}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|schrīben|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|scrīban|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*skrībaną}}, a late borrowing from {{etyl|la|de}} {{term|scrībō||write|lang=la}}, which comes from a word meaning "to scribe, to scrape". Compare Low German {{term|schrieven|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|schrijven|lang=nl}}, English {{term|shrive|lang=en}}, West Frisian {{term|skriuwe|lang=fy}}, Danish {{term|skrive|lang=da}}, Swedish {{term|skriva|lang=sv}}, Icelandic {{term|skrifa|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-at-schreiben.ogg|Audio (Austria)}}
* {{IPA|/ˈʃʁai͡b.ən/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-schreiben.ogg|Audio (Germany?)}}
* {{hyphenation|schrei|ben}}

